  "decisions": [
    "Retain the accepted route item descriptions and primary corrections; do not turn Route 26 Max Elixir back into PP Max.",
    "Read rowspans and game cells; exclude HeartGold-only rewards, Generation II/Crystal stock, demo trainers and explicitly unused rematch parties.",
    "Only local battles are imported from character pages. Distinguish Silver/Lance as allies and Clair/Lance or Ariana/Grunt as combined opponent sides.",
    "Rival starter variants, rematch stages and weekday/time conditions remain separate records.",
    "Rock Smash item results are not wild encounter slots. Repeated items in distinct rooms or services remain distinct.",
    "National Park first prize uses the actual ten-item post-National-Dex pool, including Oval Stone, checked in src/overlay_bug_contest.c.",
    "Cianwood safety Tentacool checks exactly one party member and 540 empty PC slots in scr_seq_0878_T24PC0101.s; no extra Day-Care restriction is invented.",
    "HGSS Ruins inscriptions: Kabuto Escape Rope, Aerodactyl Flash, Ho-Oh anywhere in party, Omanyte use Water Stone; old Crystal-only requirements removed.",
    "Goldenrod Sunday Return/Frustration is a one-time choice, not a weekly renewable gift. Crystal-only rooftop merchandise excluded.",
    "Separate floor pickups from shop offers, lottery/contest prizes, delivered savings purchases and breeding services.",
    "SoulSilver Game Corner awards Sandshrew, not Ekans; western/Korean Voltorb Flip and Japanese slot/ground-item differences labelled.",
    "Historical event Pokémon requirements are explicit; no promise of a current distribution, event unlock tool or new Sinjoh/Kanto locations.",
    "Fixed Frontier Brain milestones are represented, while generated opponent teams and rental pools remain linked facility references rather than invented fixed parties."
  ]
}
